Stop updating a name.

The name is not removed from your DNS. It keeps resolving to whatever
was last published and simply stops being refreshed, so it goes stale
the next time your address changes. Delete it at your provider if you
want it gone.

Usage:
  olr dial rm <name> [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for rm

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change and exit without applying it
  -o, --output string   output format: text|json (default "text")
      --socket string   olrd control socket (default "/run/olr/olrd.sock")
